"Upload</guilabel>. A standard &kde; file selection dialog will appear to select "
"the files from your computer to copying on your camera. You can select more "
"than one file using the standard &kde; selection methods."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1795
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When opictures selection is done, &digikam; will ask you where you want upload "
"the files in your camera. A camera folder selection dialog will appear. Just "
"select one folder and press OK to start uploading. All images from your "
"computer will not removed."
